1. Install the "Jira Checklist" plugin from the Atlassian Marketplace.
2. Create a new checklist in your JIRA issue by navigating to the "Checklists" section in the issue details page. Add all the items that need to be completed before the issue can move to the next column.
3. Go to your JIRA workflow configuration (Admin > Workflows).
